    "needs_better_images": true,
    "introduction": "If your dresser drawer isn’t sliding in and out properly or if it is getting stuck, you may need to replace the metal tracks. Use this guide to replace the metal tracks in your dresser drawer.",
    "tools_and_materials": [
        {
            "name": "Staple Gun",
